WEBVTT

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:32.167
pou n pini moun ki fè krim sa yo.

00:17:32.167 --> 00:17:34.467
Pinisyon nou yo konvenab

00:17:34.467 --> 00:17:36.533
paske nou dwe pini moun ki fè sa k pa sa.

00:17:36.533 --> 00:17:40.100
Men gen 3 nan krim sa yo, nou te ka epanye.

00:17:40.100 --> 00:17:43.010
Si nou pa gade pi byen

00:17:43.172 --> 00:17:47.816
pou nou konsantre sou chapit ki o kòmansman yo,

00:17:47.816 --> 00:17:51.200
nou p ap janm ka ekri premye fraz

00:17:51.200 --> 00:17:52.994
ki kòmanse wout pèn lanmó a.

00:17:52.994 --> 00:17:54.700
Mèsi!

00:17:54.700 --> 00:17:56.031
(Aplodisman...)